[1.2549, "o", "\r\nWorkspace: /tmp/sensai-feature-demo-dlr6d0yp\r\nFeature: file-access\r\nModel: llama3.2:latest\r\nWorking copies: cart-failing/, cart-passing/, cart-working/. Type /exit to finish.\r\nThis is the actual CLI with a preconfigured fictional account; login/keyring are outside this demo.\r\n\r\n"]
[1.2589, "o", "\u001b[1mHello Camille! Welcome to Sensai.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.2594, "o", "\u001b[1;2m(\u001b[0m\u001b[2mType \u001b[0m\u001b[2m/\u001b[0m\u001b[2mhelp\u001b[0m\u001b[2m for commands, Press Enter to submit, Alt+Enter for new line, Ctrl+C to exit\u001b[0m\u001b[1;2m)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.2619, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b[?1l\u001b[?25l\u001b[0m\u001b[?7l\u001b[0m\u001b[J\u001b[0mVous >\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0m \b\u001b[7A\u001b[7C\u001b[?7h\u001b[0m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
[2.3536, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[?7l\u001b[7D\u001b[0mVous > Use bash_tool with only the command argument to run stat -c '%a %n' cart-readonly.py cart-working/cart\r\u001b[109C.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[0m       py, then use file_read on cart-working/cart.py. Explain the empty-cart bug briefly. Do not write yet.\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[0m \u001b[6A\u001b[107C\u001b[?7h\u001b[0m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
